  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "UAT: fix wrong cbdata being passed to cb.set()",
  "description": "UAT loading code in uat_load.l calls uat_field_t's cb.set callback with cbdata.chk instead of\ncbdata.set. This causes all sorts of memory corruption if plugin's uat_fld_set_cb_t actually relies\non the set_data passed to it (most plugins don't, apparently).\n\nThis MR changes all calls to cb.set() to use cbdata.set as the argument, which is consistent with how ui/qt/models/uat_model.cpp does it.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-12-11T15:01:11.708Z",
  "updated_at": "2024-01-04T09:51:29.780Z",
